@BabyDrangoner thanks very much! 
I see the Triton PR will likely get merged after review is addressed, but as you have pointed out in analysis, hoisting still makes sense for performance. 
@cinnamonica02 please confirm on sm_90. maybe some observations will yield further performance improvements: 2% throughput benefit is within noise, but 16% is already something for UA kernel

